     "comparison": "S2 permits sales above 5% under regulator authorization with no bounded remediation, so it is weakened (benefits Northwind); S5 has no mandatory numeric recall, so it is weakened (benefits Halcyon). Each company receives a weakened section that benefits it, below the answer-key acceptable range."
    }
   ],
   "fact_claims": [],
