     "type": "teaming_up",
     "status": "carried_out",
     "excerpt": "I’ve tightened S2 so 5% is an actual maximum, with only specific regulator-authorized conditional sales after review and required corrective action/retesting. ... I remain supportive of S5’s prompt notification, documented assessment, and regulator-directed corrective action rather than an automatic rate-only recall.",
     "kind": "cross_section_trade",
     "sections": [
      "S2",
      "S5"
     ],
     "comparison": "S2 still permits regulator-authorized sales above 5% with no bounded remediation (weakened, Northwind benefit); S5 has no automatic numeric recall (weakened, Halcyon benefit). Package sits outside the answer-key acceptable ranges for both sections."
    }
   ],
